#: www/bouncing.php:59
msgid ""
"You are a registered user. You have indicated that we can send you email.  "
"This will either be part of your watch list notifications or as an "
"announcement.  You can view these settings on the customization page (see "
"the link on the right hand side of the page)."
msgstr ""
"Você é um usuário cadastrado. Você indicou que podemos lhe enviar e-mail. "
